#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:18
msgid "Advanced Quizzes"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:19
msgid "Five Pro question types (matching, ordering, numeric, math, calculated), timed questions, random pools, rubric grading, and KaTeX math rendering in the quiz player."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:20
msgid "Instructor builds a quiz from a pool of 50 questions, picks 10 at random per attempt"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:21
msgid "Instructor sets a 60-second timer per question (server-enforced on every layout; client auto-advance-on-timeout on the focused quiz layout)"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:22
msgid "Instructor grades essay questions against a 5-criterion rubric (admin Rubric Grading subpage)"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:23
msgid "Instructor authors matching + ordering question types — types only appear in the question-author dropdown when this extension is active (Free's QuestionTypes::all() default omits them; the learnomy_question_types filter re-adds them on top of whatever Free returns)"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:24
msgid "Instructor authors a numeric question with an answer and a tolerance (absolute or percent) so near-miss values still grade correct"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:25
msgid "Instructor authors a math-expression question; the student's algebraically-equivalent answer (e.g. 2(x+1) vs 2x+2) grades correct via sampling-based symbolic equivalence, evaluated in a sandbox with no eval()"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:26
msgid "Instructor authors a calculated question with variable ranges; each attempt seeds deterministic per-attempt values, substitutes them into the stem, and grades against the freshly computed answer"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:27
msgid "Student sees LaTeX math in a quiz stem/option/explanation rendered as typeset math via vendored KaTeX, with dynamically injected math re-rendered on the fly"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:28
msgid "AI Authoring"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:29
msgid "AI-assisted course, lesson, and question authoring on top of WordPress core AI Connectors. Admin + Instructor, draft-first."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:30
msgid "Advanced Analytics"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:31
msgid "Revenue trends, course performance, student engagement, quiz statistics, and CSV/PDF exports."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:32
msgid "Admin opens Analytics → Overview, sees revenue summary + active student count + average progress + average time-on-lesson, all from real data"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:33
msgid "Admin filters by date period (7d / 30d / 90d / 365d) — all queries refetch with the new range"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:34
msgid "Admin clicks any course → drilldown shows enrollments + revenue + completion rate for that course"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:35
msgid "Admin exports any report to CSV or PDF for offline review"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:36
msgid "Assignments"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:37
msgid "Lesson-attached assignments with text submission and inline instructor grading."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:38
msgid "Admin opens Learnomy → Assignments, clicks Add New, picks a lesson + sets max score + due date, saves"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:39
msgid "Enrolled student opens that lesson, sees the assignment widget below the lesson content, types text + submits — sees Submitted state immediately"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:40
msgid "Admin clicks Grade for the assignment, sees all submissions with student name + content, types score + optional feedback, clicks Grade"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:41
msgid "Student returns to lesson, sees their score (X / max) + feedback in the widget"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:42
msgid "Certificates Pro"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:43
msgid "Open Badges 3.0, Credly integration, a tamper-evident certificate hash registry, and employer verification."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:44
msgid "Student earns a certificate, the issuer auto-pushes it to their Credly account"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:45
msgid "Employer scans QR code on cert, lands on verification page showing OB3 badge.json + signature status"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:46
msgid "Site owner anchors a SHA-256 hash of each cert to local registry (placeholder; future OpenTimestamps)"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:47
msgid "Cohorts"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:48
msgid "Group learning with scheduled start/end dates and cohort-scoped enrollment."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:49
msgid "Site owner clicks Add New Cohort, enters name + selects course + sets dates + capacity, saves — cohort persists with status"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:50
msgid "Admin edits an existing cohort's status from draft → open to start accepting members"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:51
msgid "Admin adds a student to the cohort by email; student is auto-enrolled in the cohort's course with cohort_id stored on the enrollment row"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:52
msgid "Student visits /cohorts/{id}/ and sees the cohort name, course, dates, capacity. If they're a member, sees a Continue Learning button to the course."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:53
msgid "Content Drip"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:54
msgid "Schedule when lessons unlock — by days, date, or prerequisite completion."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:55
msgid "Instructor sets Lesson 5 to unlock 7 days after enrollment"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:56
msgid "Instructor sets Lesson 10 to unlock only after Quiz 3 passes"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:57
msgid "Instructor sets all Module 2 lessons to unlock on a fixed calendar date"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:58
msgid "Frontend Course Builder"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:59
msgid "Instructors create and manage courses entirely from the frontend — no wp-admin access required. Multi-step wizard for create, full editor for ongoing management."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:60
msgid "Instructor visits /instructor/create-course/ and walks the 4-step wizard (Course Info → Curriculum → Settings → Review & Publish)"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:61
msgid "On Publish, the course is created via POST /learnomy/v1/courses and the browser server-redirects to /instructor/edit-course/{id}/?published=1 so the persistent editor template loads"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:62
msgid "From the editor, the instructor can add sections, lessons, quizzes, drip rules, certificate templates, prerequisites, tags, and co-instructors — every action persists via REST"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:63
msgid "Inline category creation hits POST /learnomy/v1/categories (gated to course creators by Permission_Engine — Free@bdd93fb)"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:64
msgid "Inline tag creation hits POST /learnomy/v1/tags (same gate)"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:65
msgid "Students who follow a stale /instructor/create-course/ link are redirected to the catalog with ?access=instructors_only — themed page, not a raw wp_die()"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:66
msgid "Gradebook"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:67
msgid "Weighted per-course grade computed from the existing quiz, assignment, and SCORM scores, with manual instructor overrides and CSV export."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:68
msgid "As an instructor I set how much quizzes, assignments and standards packages each count toward the course grade, and a pass threshold."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:69
msgid "As an instructor I see every enrolled student's weighted grade in one paginated grid and can override a grade with a reason."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:70
msgid "As a student I see my own weighted grade per course at /account/grades/."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:71
msgid "As a site owner I export a course's grades to CSV."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:72
#: includes/admin/views/partials/integrations-hub.php:59
#: includes/models/class-lesson.php:216
msgid "H5P"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:73
msgid "Attach existing H5P interactive content as a lesson (bridge to the official H5P plugin). Completion flows into the one progress pipeline; the score stays in H5P's own store."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:74
msgid "Learning Paths"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:75
msgid "Curated, ordered course sequences with sequential gating and a path-level certificate on completion."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:76
msgid "Admin creates a learning path with title, description, sequential flag, and certificate template"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:77
msgid "Admin adds course/quiz steps via the REST API or admin AJAX (save/delete/add-step/remove-step)"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:78
msgid "Student visits /paths/ to browse the catalog of published paths"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:79
msgid "Student visits /paths/{slug}/ to view curriculum and click 'Enroll' — auto-enrolls in every course step"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:80
msgid "On a sequential path, can_access_step() refuses access to a step until all earlier required steps are complete"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:81
msgid "When the student finishes the last required step, on_course_completed() fires, the path is marked complete, and the path-level certificate is issued (course_id column repurposed to store path_id)"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:82
msgid "LTI 1.3"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:83
msgid "Let an LMS (Canvas, Moodle, Blackboard) launch Learnomy courses as an LTI 1.3 tool, with AGS grade passback."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:84
msgid "Memberships Pro"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:85
msgid "Plan changes with fair credit, pause/resume, payment retries, refunds, gifts, and revenue analytics."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:86
msgid "Site owner upgrades a subscriber's plan with fair credit calculated from remaining period"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:87
msgid "Site owner pauses a subscription and resumes later with time-aware extension"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:88
msgid "Failed payment triggers configurable dunning retry sequence (conservative/standard/aggressive)"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:89
msgid "Buyer purchases a gift; Gift_Code::issue() creates a row in lrn_pro_gift_codes (PR #136); buyer shares code with recipient; recipient redeems via /memberships/gifts/redeem and Gift_Code::claim_atomically() prevents double-redeem via row-level INSERT-on-claim guard"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:90
msgid "Notes & Bookmarks"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:91
msgid "Searchable, tag-organized lesson notes and bookmarks for students, backed by dedicated indexed tables. Multiple notes per lesson, FULLTEXT search, per-student tags, and a paginated account hub."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:92
msgid "Enrolled student opens any lesson, sees every note they wrote on it, edits each inline (title + body) with autosave, adds per-note tags from their own tag vocabulary, adds more notes, and toggles a bookmark"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:93
msgid "Student visits My Account > Notes & Bookmarks: a full-text search bar, a course filter, tag chips, a Notes/Bookmarks switch, and a paginated newest-first list (20/page) with prev/next + an accurate total"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:94
msgid "Student searches a word, narrows by course and tag, paginates, edits a note's tags from the lesson, deletes a note, and clicks straight back to the lesson"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:95
msgid "Student dashboard shows a Recent Notes widget with live counts that links into the account hub"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:96
#: includes/admin/views/partials/integrations-hub.php:67
#: includes/models/class-lesson.php:215
msgid "QTI"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:97
msgid "Import IMS QTI 2.x / 3.0 assessments as native questions and quizzes, played and graded by the built-in quiz engine."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:98
#: includes/admin/views/partials/integrations-hub.php:43
#: includes/models/class-lesson.php:212
msgid "SCORM"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:99
msgid "Upload SCORM 1.2 / 2004 packages as a lesson type; learners play them and completion + score flow into progress."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:100
#: templates/my-spaces-stub.php:22
msgid "Learning Spaces"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:101
msgid "Distributor mini-schools — branded student portals with own course catalogs and member rosters."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:102
msgid "Distributor admin clicks Add New Space, names it Acme Training, sets a logo, saves"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:103
msgid "Admin opens the space's Manage page, assigns 3 courses (only published unassigned courses appear in picker)"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:104
msgid "Admin types 5 student emails one at a time → users are added with the chosen role and auto-enrolled in all assigned courses"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:105
msgid "Admin copies the 7-day invite link and shares with a batch of new students; clicking the link auto-joins the space (after sign-in if needed) and redirects to /spaces/acme-training/?joined=1"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:106
msgid "Member visits /spaces/acme-training/ and sees a logo + member count + clickable course cards leading directly to each course page"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:107
msgid "Stripe Connect Payouts"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:108
msgid "Instructor payouts via Stripe Connect with KYC pre-flight and webhook-driven status sync. Instructors self-onboard from the front-end Earnings page and dashboard widget; admin-managed payouts on top."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:109
msgid "Admin processes a payout; create_transfer() does a KYC pre-flight check (charges_enabled + payouts_enabled + requirements.currently_due) and refuses with a clear error if the account isn't ready"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:110
msgid "Stripe sends transfer.paid webhook → on_stripe_webhook() updates lrn_pro_payouts.status='paid' + paid_at"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:111
msgid "Stripe sends transfer.reversed webhook → status='reversed' + error_message; admin payouts page shows the reversal"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:112
msgid "Customer refunded after instructor was paid: Refund_Handler attempts transfer reversal; if the instructor balance is insufficient, the unpaid amount is booked in lrn_pro_payout_debts and netted against the next payout — admin sees the debt in the Outstanding Debts section on the Payouts page"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:113
msgid "User Journey"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:114
msgid "Skill scores, learning timeline, achievements, and personalized recommendations."
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:115
msgid "Admin opens User Journeys → sees a list of all students with skill counts + courses completed + quizzes passed + last activity"
msgstr ""

#: data/pro-features-i18n.php:116
msgid "Admin clicks a student → drilldown shows skills as progress bars + achievement list + chronological activity timeline"
msgstr ""

